<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Qantas provides a meet and assist service to passengers who require guidance and assistance proceeding through airport facilities and/or the handling of documents. This service must be requested at the time of booking.<br />
<br />
On arrival at the airport, if the passenger requires kerbside pickup, the passenger must be accompanied by someone who can advise our staff that a wheelchair is required kerbside.<br />
<br />
Qantas wheelchairs are not permitted in airport carparks.<br />
<br />
Please note, assistance may be subject to staff availability on the day and cannot always be guaranteed.<br />
<br />
If you require further assistance regarding meet and assist service, please reply back to this email or contact the Qantas Customer Specific Needs team between 6am and 10pm (AEST), Monday to Sunday on 1800 177 474 (within Australia) or +61 2 9123 7471 (outside Australia) on1800 177 474, option 3.</body>
</html>